1
00:00:00,026 --> 00:00:02,526
(Meemaw:)I appreciate your honesty, dear.

2
00:00:02,529 --> 00:00:04,429
(Sheldon:)Thank you.
And here's

3
00:00:04,431 --> 00:00:05,761
some more honesty:

4
00:00:05,765 --> 00:00:08,495
(Meemaw:)I don't like you very much.

5
00:00:10,236 --> 00:00:11,836
(Amy:)Well, maybe I don't
like you either.

6
00:00:11,838 --> 00:00:13,108
No, no, no, no, no,

7
00:00:13,106 --> 00:00:15,376
no, no, no. Y-You have
to like each other.

8
00:00:15,375 --> 00:00:18,345
Well, we have a 4:30 reservation
at Applebee's.

9
00:00:20,547 --> 00:00:22,547
(Amy:)I think I should leave.

10
00:00:22,549 --> 00:00:24,019
(Sheldon:)But why?

11
00:00:24,017 --> 00:00:25,617
(Sheldon:)Other than
you two fighting,

12
00:00:25,618 --> 00:00:28,288
(Sheldon:)we're having such a good time.

13
00:00:28,288 --> 00:00:31,018
(Amy:)The minute you left the room,
your precious meemaw

14
00:00:31,024 --> 00:00:32,924
(Amy:)started giving me
a really hard time.

15
00:00:32,926 --> 00:00:34,296
(Amy:)I don't need this.

16
00:00:34,294 --> 00:00:35,294
(Meemaw:)Let her go.

17
00:00:35,295 --> 00:00:37,225
(Meemaw:)And under no circumstance

18
00:00:37,230 --> 00:00:40,030
(Meemaw:)will you give her
that engagement ring.

19
00:00:41,201 --> 00:00:42,171
(Amy:)What ring?

20
00:00:42,168 --> 00:00:44,868
(Leonard:)Maybe we should give
them some privacy.

21
00:00:44,871 --> 00:00:45,941
(Penny:)Yeah, yeah, yeah.

22
00:00:45,939 --> 00:00:47,909
(Penny:)You go ahead.
I'll catch up with you.

23
00:00:50,143 --> 00:00:52,343
(Sheldon:)You have
an engagement ring?

24
00:00:52,345 --> 00:00:54,375
(Penny:)Yes.

25
00:00:55,215 --> 00:00:57,685
(Amy:)Penny, did you know
about this?

26
00:00:57,684 --> 00:01:07,024
(Penny:)All right, let's go.

